# FireCalc Docker — Source Version Pins
#
# Each value is a full 40-char Git commit SHA.
#
# Clone mode (default): the deploy script clones each repo at its pinned ref
# before building artifacts.
#
# Local-tree mode (FIRECALC_BUILD_LOCAL=true, the rsync-based VPS flow): no
# clone happens and the build host needs no git credentials. The pins keep
# their full provenance meaning:
#   firecalc — names the exact engine stamp source. The deploy script requires
#     an annotated tag `engine-<version>` (ADR-0007) peeling to this SHA and
#     proves the working tree byte-identical to that tag across the published
#     engine modules before publishing them at the pinned version.
#   firecalc-firebox-austrian-api — must equal the local private checkout's
#     HEAD exactly; that tree is built as-is.
#
# To update a pin after a release, replace the SHA and commit this file.

# Public repository (AGPL-3.0)
# Contains: payments backend, reports, invoices, UI (Scala.js + Vite)
firecalc=e4142f56dc205e68fddd6a7c129cad2d4385d322

# Private repository (AFPMA Proprietary)
# Contains: firebox_calc_server (Austrian calculation engine)
firecalc-firebox-austrian-api=131ec13ba34e7cb5a2129e7f3da8daedcb47a8a3
